# POLLY, pages: the X0X page map (a button always opens its first page; SELECT, and only SELECT, turns them), the
# keys by screen, HOME held + a key / SELECT / PRESETS, HOME's LOOP knob, the song's tempo and transpose.
# Pages: 0 Home, 1-2 Song (3: no longer shown), 4-5 Progression, 6 Band, 7 Groove length, 8 Sound, 9 Sound 2,
# 10 Mixer, 11 Mixer tone, 12 Effects, 13-14 Style, 15 Setup, 16 Status
# Home is its own page now (SELECT does nothing there); HOME on Home opens Song; HOME anywhere else (Song, Song 2,
# or any other page) goes back to Home.
wait 300
expect page 0
turn SELECT 1
expect page 0
tap HOME
expect page 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
shot song2_dots.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 1
turn SELECT -1
expect page 2
tap HOME
expect page 0
turn SELECT 1
expect page 0
tap HOME
expect page 1
tap HOME
expect page 0
tap ARP
expect page 4
tap ARP
expect page 4
turn SELECT 1
expect page 5
tap ARP
expect page 4
tap SEQ
expect page 6
turn SELECT 1
expect page 7
turn SELECT 1
expect page 6
turn SELECT -1
expect page 7
tap EDIT
expect page 8
tap EDIT
expect page 8
turn SELECT 1
expect page 9
tap LFO
expect page 10
tap LFO
expect page 10
turn SELECT 1
expect page 11
tap FX
expect page 12
tap FX
expect page 12
turn SELECT 1
expect page 12
tap ENV
expect page 13
turn SELECT 1
expect page 14
shot style2.png
tap ENV
expect page 13
tap GLO
expect page 15
shot setup.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 16
# SEQ held: its card (SELECT for the next page); let go, nothing
press SEQ
wait 1100
shot card_seq.png
release SEQ
expect page 16
# the keys: the selected track on SEQ, nothing on FX, the track on LFO's black keys
tap SEQ
key 7 down
wait 200
expect voices >0
key 7 up
wait 1500
tap FX
key 7 down
wait 200
expect voices 0
key 7 up
tap LFO
tapkey b2
expect track 3
tapkey w2
expect track 3
tapkey b6
expect track 7
# HOME held + SELECT: the tempo (the song's); HOME's release then turns no page
tap HOME
expect page 0
expect tempo 105
press HOME
spin SELECT 5
release HOME
expect tempo 110
expect song1_tempo 110
expect page 0
# HOME held + PRESETS: the song (stopped: at once), with its own tempo
press HOME
turn PRESET 1
release HOME
expect song 2
expect tempo 105
expect page 0
press HOME
turn PRESET -1
release HOME
expect song 1
expect tempo 110
# HOME held + black key 2: Main B first
press HOME
tapkey b2
release HOME
expect msg_is_FIRST 1
expect next_sect 3
# HOME's knobs: TRANSPOSE, LOOP ("-" FREE, L1..L16)
spin K3 2
expect transpose 2
spin K3 -9
expect transpose -6
spin K3 6
expect transpose 0
spin K4 2
wait 50
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 2
shot home_loop_knob.png
spin K4 20
wait 50
expect app_loop 16
spin K4 -1
wait 50
expect app_loop 15
spin K4 -20
wait 50
expect mode 0
# HOME held + white key 3: L3 (LOOP); playing, the loop goes round; HOME + white 3 again: FREE
press HOME
tapkey w2
release HOME
wait 50
expect mode 1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect loop_now 3
shot home_loop.png
press HOME
tapkey w2
release HOME
wait 50
expect mode 0
expect loop_now 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
# REC on HOME in FREE: a new loop's take (no track recording); leaving HOME ends it (no chords: no loop)
tap REC
expect msg_is_REC 1
expect recording 0
# HOME + a white key from another screen (SEQ): the loop, the page stays
tap SEQ
press HOME
tapkey w4
release HOME
expect page 6
expect mode 1
tap PLAY
wait 2500
expect loop_now 5
# PRESETS on HOME: the next loop (from the next bar line)
tap HOME
expect page 0
turn PRESET 1
wait 2500
expect loop_now 6
tap PLAY
wait 500
# a section in the song (P6: a song with no sections never plays as the song), C3 muted in it (as the song will be)
tap HOME
tapkey w5
turn K1 -1
tapkey b6
expect rows 1
tap HOME
# mutes: SEQ's MUTE in LOOP is the song's; in SONG by hand only (the engine's); back in LOOP the song's again
tap SEQ
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect song1_mute 64
expect mutes 64
tap HOME
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 50
expect mode 2
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap HOME
shot home_song_knob.png
tap SEQ
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect song1_mute 64
expect mutes 0
tap HOME
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect mode 1
expect mutes 64
# HOME held + a knob: HOME used (its release turns no page)
press HOME
spin K2 1
release HOME
expect page 0
expect tempo 111
# the Setup's lights on KNOB 3 (no Key knob)
tap GLO
spin K3 1
expect lit_GLO 1
# ---- a page button always opens its first page: ARP, SELECT: page 2; ARP: page 1; HOME + a key (a shortcut),
# then ARP: page 1, the LOOP screen of the loop picked
tap ARP
expect page 4
turn SELECT 1
expect page 5
tap ARP
expect page 4
press HOME
tapkey w1
release HOME
expect msgtext_is_PROGRESSION_P2_BALLAD 1
tap ARP
expect page 4
expect app_loop 2
# ---- REC acts on its release: held for its card (on HOME in FREE: "a new loop"), nothing starts
tap HOME
expect page 0
spin K4 -2
wait 50
expect mode 0
press REC
wait 1100
expect card 12
expect take 0
release REC
expect take 0
expect rec_chords 0
# a tap: the take waits for PLAY at once; again: it ends (no chords, no loop)
tap REC
expect take 1
tap REC
expect take 0
expect msgtext_is_NO_CHORDS_NO_NEW_PROGRESSION 1
